  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "えいしんってばケンキョだなー。\nったく、そんなんじゃ戦いがいがねーぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オレたち、同じ事務所の仲間でライバルじゃん。\n細かいことは気にしねーで、かかってこいよな！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それに、みなさんはボクたちより\n先輩の高校生ですから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "先輩かぁ～。\n315プロダクションって、いろんな先輩がいるよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "るいせんせいは、英語がすごーい先輩でしょ。\nつばさくんとけいくんは、ふわふわの先輩！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "せいじさんとみちるさんはムキムキの先輩だから……\nあ！　じろうせんせいは、ヨレヨレのせんぱ……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "か、かのんくん！\nえっと、本当に、たくさんの先輩がいるよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_06_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うんっ。みんな優しくて楽しいから、かのん大好き！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_06_b:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
